import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Financial & Legal Disclaimer | MegaMoneyMomentum (MMM)"
  description="Important legal, tax, and investment disclaimers for MegaMoneyMomentum readers and global investors navigating Korean financial regulations."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="container-article">
    <header class="article-header">
      <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-amber); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        YMYL Legal Disclosure
      </div>
      <h1 class="article-title">Financial & Legal Disclaimer</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-light);">
        Last Updated: January 1, 2026 | Effective Date: January 1, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="article-content">
      <div class="callout callout-warning">
        <div class="callout-title">⚠️ Mandatory Financial Disclosure</div>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
          All information published on <strong>MegaMoneyMomentum (MMM)</strong>—including tax settlement guides, ISA investment simulations, overseas stock dividend analyses, mortgage regulations, and government subsidy checklists—is prepared strictly for <strong>educational and general informational purposes</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. No Individual Financial or Tax Advice</h2>
      <p>
        The content on this site does not constitute personalized financial planning, legal counsel, accounting advice, or investment recommendations tailored to your unique financial situation, income bracket, residency status, or tax jurisdiction.
      </p>
      <p>
        Korean tax laws (Income Tax Act, Restriction of Special Taxation Act) and financial regulations change frequently. Application of these rules depends entirely on your specific facts. Before executing tax filings, subscribing to financial products, or making investment decisions, always consult a licensed professional—such as a Certified Public Accountant (CPA), Certified Tax Accountant (CTA), or authorized bank/brokerage officer.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Simulation Tool Estimates & Accuracy Limitations</h2>
      <p>
        Our interactive simulators (e.g., ETF Compound Return & Covered Call Tax Shield Simulator, Real Estate Tax Calculator) utilize generalized statutory formulas and hypothetical parameters. Actual withholding rates, capital gains taxes, and transaction fees may differ based on your full financial year aggregate income and local tax assessments.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Limitation of Investment Liability</h2>
      <p>
        All investments—including domestic/foreign ETFs, fixed income securities, mutual funds, and foreign currency assets—carry inherent risk of capital loss. MegaMoneyMomentum and its contributors expressly disclaim any and all liability for direct, indirect, or consequential financial losses incurred as a result of using or relying on any content or tool on this site.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Official Regulatory Source Verification</h2>
      <p>
        We strongly urge all readers to cross-reference our analysis against primary government portals:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>National Tax Service (NTS / Hometax):</strong> <a href="https://www.nts.go.kr/english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nts.go.kr/english</a></li>
        <li><strong>Ministry of Economy & Finance:</strong> <a href="https://www.moef.go.kr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">moef.go.kr</a></li>
        <li><strong>Financial Supervisory Service (FSS):</strong> <a href="https://fine.fss.or.kr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fine.fss.or.kr</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
